NOTE Track: Mirrors of Yesterday (1-06)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.700
[Warm Analog Synth Pad & Flowing Wooden Flute Intro]

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.500
The dust has settled on the keys

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:53.000
A whisper in the willow trees

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.800
I see a face I used to know

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.200
In a mirror from along ago

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.200
