00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.500
The shadows of a yesterday

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.200
Turn the page and let the colours fade

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.200
In the mirrors of the lives we made!

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.800
We are looking through a broken lens

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.800
Finding where the circle ends and begins!

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.500
Mirrors of yesterday...

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:44.000
[Melodic Flute & Synthesizer Interlude]

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:48.000
